// Module `analysis`: the shared analysis facade for tooling (spec 18 §2, ADR-0008).
// Pure functions over a Workspace (overlay of editor buffers); used by `orin lsp` / `orin mcp`. The only file access is
// through the loader's `Sources` (with the grant passed in); the command-line drivers of `orin graph` / `diff` / `effects`
// are in `compiler/tools`.
